  "solution": "<p><strong>1.</strong> Let the common value be v. It is positive, and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>&#x02260;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></math> because the nonzero a makes <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><msup><mn>5</mn><mi>a</mi></msup><mo>&#x02260;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></math>. Taking logarithms gives <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>log</mi><mn>5</mn><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>log</mi><mn>10</mn><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mi>log</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></math>.</p><p><strong>2.</strong> Therefore <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&#x0002F;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mi>log</mi><mn>5</mn><mo>&#x0002F;</mo><mi>log</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&#x0002F;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>&#x0002F;</mo><mi>log</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&#x0002F;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mi>log</mi><mn>10</mn><mo>&#x0002F;</mo><mi>log</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></math>.</p><p><strong>3.</strong> Their sum is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00028;</mo><mi>log</mi><mn>5</mn><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mi>log</mi><mn>10</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00029;</mo><mo>&#x0002F;</mo><mi>log</mi><mi>v</mi><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></math>, since <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>&#x000B7;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></math>. Answer B. The minus sign in the exponent <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></math> is essential.</p>"
